{
  "_about": "Every zenthros.ai/* label and annotation key the SDK (sdk/python/zenthros) names, with its owner on each side: go is the constant of operator/api/v1 with that value (null when only the SDK names it), sdk the SDK's constant. set_by and read_by say who writes and who reads it, on is what carries it. operator/test/lint TestTheSDKsKeysAreTheOperators holds api/v1 and the chart's policy to it; sdk/python/tests/test_keys.py holds the SDK to it, and finds a key the SDK names that is not here.",
